  "display_title": "My Dear Tyrant",
  "description": "In an attempt to overthrow her tyrannical brother and father, Princess Erinyes Taltal colluded with House Lowenthal... only to have the plot end with the family's death. Her last hope is Tristan Lowenthal, who managed to survive by becoming her slave. But her plans to have him become the leader of the revolt go awry when she discovers Tristan has no interest in reclaiming his family's title or fortune. With such dismal prospects, will Erinyes be able to emerge as the victor in this battle?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
